{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.018950389327373807,"t":"Reading","x":0.83899832313190736,"w":0.085588150024414111,"y":0.0632413822314013,"c":1},{"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","h":0.016048292108362783,"x":0.084362139019228594,"y":0.10895170802939236,"w":0.31069959004720049,"c":1},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","y":0.14499235933923038,"h":0.023118567270159929,"c":1,"x":0.084238259764461809,"w":0.82739446004231754},{"h":0.019149524163020404,"c":1,"w":0.17154499053955077,"t":"Passage 2 below.","x":0.081924949019172383,"y":0.16259238738880033},{"y":0.20416912561930101,"x":0.2466117855082903,"t":"Bring back the big cats","w":0.51086380004882814,"h":0.040655502301363278,"c":1},{"t":"It's time to start returning vanished native animals to Britain, says John Vesty","w":0.69799875895182284,"x":0.1499915636795735,"y":0.25356681103304501,"h":0.023896989047316741,"c":1},{"w":0.37890581766764325,"h":0.020487211337499422,"t":"There is a poem, written around 598 AD,","x":0.078043140166150993,"c":1,"y":0.29060255921789024},{"t":"which describes hunting a mystery animal","h":0.020472073863897711,"x":0.078042666499539781,"w":0.38504776000976565,"y":0.3074975957352728,"c":1},{"x":0.077931566997153631,"y":0.324650616839536,"h":0.021323315246366326,"w":0.38122451782226563,"c":1,"t":"called a llewyn. But what was it? Nothing"},{"h":0.024508149379554922,"x":0.07587525230358115,"c":1,"w":0.39154202779134112,"y":0.33996315337653149,"t":"seemed to fit, until 2006, when an animal"},{"t":"bone, dating from around the same","y":0.36189634871020804,"x":0.078189296543702186,"h":0.017464116549182895,"c":1,"w":0.32921811421712244},{"x":0.078189305763356406,"y":0.37926972921757385,"w":0.36419751485188795,"h":0.018986084155115268,"t":"period, was found in the Kinsey Cave in","c":1},{"y":0.39684306895245869,"c":1,"t":"northern England. Until this discovery, the","x":0.078027220339497064,"w":0.38099690755208337,"h":0.019177326746065537},{"x":0.076131691534862392,"w":0.36008229573567713,"t":"lynx - a large spotted cat with tasselled","h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"y":0.41715116265590568},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371257085521,"t":"ears - was presumed to have died out in","y":0.43313953514180603,"w":0.37242797851562504,"x":0.076131693026138078},{"w":0.35596707661946614,"x":0.076131687915660773,"t":"Britain at least 6,000 years ago, before","y":0.45200235583720061,"h":0.018927876323075465,"c":1},{"t":"the inhabitants of these islands took up","x":0.075851094865944046,"w":0.36271993001302083,"h":0.0200319930437175,"y":0.46705533490432094,"c":1},{"w":0.38507181803385421,"x":0.073914465438623386,"t":"farming. But the 2006 find, together with","y":0.48663927543688823,"h":0.019934662098878952,"c":1},{"x":0.073979001680581913,"w":0.37674466451009109,"t":"three others in Yorkshire and Scotland, is","c":1,"h":0.020424014968782211,"y":0.50428504650460726},{"w":0.38477366129557294,"c":1,"y":0.52325581379870856,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"compelling evidence that the lynx and the","x":0.074074074523395553},{"h":0.017667844522968101,"x":0.074074077885129319,"y":0.53916372206912011,"t":"mysterious Ilewyn were in fact one and the","w":0.39506172180175786,"c":1},{"h":0.022191118435809121,"y":0.55633998930786033,"w":0.36275444030761722,"c":1,"t":"same animal. If this is so, it would bring","x":0.073785379203033588},{"h":0.018246661367068207,"y":0.5749514790337058,"c":1,"w":0.36462605794270836,"x":0.071818474325837559,"t":"forward the tassel-eared cat's estimated"},{"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"x":0.074074078341274399,"t":"extinction date by roughly 5,000 years.","w":0.36008229573567707,"y":0.59447674456815236},{"x":0.072016465794571521,"t":"However, this is not quite the last glimpse","c":1,"y":0.62209302308565895,"h":0.017482948527880904,"w":0.38271603902180995},{"t":"of the animal in British culture. A 9th-","x":0.071749617067457902,"c":1,"y":0.63701700627139923,"w":0.35033192952473957,"h":0.020854601730867839},{"h":0.019982570472959926,"t":"century stone cross from the Isle of Eigg","x":0.07187134326542946,"c":1,"y":0.65601492292946029,"w":0.36656873067220053},{"c":1,"t":"shows, alongside the deer, boar and","w":0.33333333333333337,"x":0.069958847605983435,"y":0.67579505304885834,"h":0.017518900589330699},{"y":0.69155321806020809,"x":0.071753429390091744,"t":"aurochs pursued by a mounted hunter, a","w":0.37498097737630198,"h":0.020940980585500313,"c":1},{"x":0.069958842411285554,"h":0.015988371257085521,"w":0.40329218546549483,"t":"speckled cat with tasselled ears. Were it not","y":0.71075581421157352,"c":1},{"w":0.40172053019205733,"t":"for the animal's backside having worn away","h":0.019483022611188949,"c":1,"x":0.069730278452571876,"y":0.72772430716744296},{"c":1,"h":0.020189341442885422,"y":0.74599179538434979,"t":"with time, we could have been certain, as","x":0.069803370713013346,"w":0.38507858276367191},{"y":0.76388092034032062,"h":0.018344833095447211,"w":0.37682253519694014,"t":"the lynx's stubby tail is unmistakable. But","c":1,"x":0.069813887302317704},{"c":1,"x":0.069958853768591164,"y":0.78343023239517207,"w":0.37654319763183597,"t":"even without this key teature, it's hard to","h":0.017512052443900861},{"x":0.067674363949204994,"y":0.79685759753838115,"h":0.021594023957269393,"t":"see what else the creature could have been.","w":0.40595514933268229,"c":1},{"t":"The lynx is now becoming the totemic","w":0.35185185750325521,"c":1,"y":0.81831395332634838,"h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.067901231636824808},{"t":"animal of a movement that is transforming","x":0.069691085106878797,"y":0.8329688383626781,"w":0.39356717427571608,"c":1,"h":0.021823321410988972},{"x":0.069709054214100563,"y":0.85182326867254143,"t":"British environmentalism: rewilding.","h":0.01903228849628924,"c":1,"w":0.32976768493652342},{"y":0.88049218402118246,"x":0.067766761309714804,"w":0.3747443389892578,"h":0.01915839591773294,"c":1,"t":"Rewilding means the mass restoration of"},{"h":0.01864273893538293,"x":0.067760847222179829,"t":"damaged ecosystems. It involves letting","y":0.89857893660303345,"c":1,"w":0.36241683959960935},{"t":"trees return to places that have been","y":0.29358068365190848,"w":0.33539093017578125,"x":0.51646091297280894,"c":1,"h":0.018919315720053898},{"w":0.35185185750325532,"h":0.019140164899882239,"t":"denuded, allowing parts of the seabed","y":0.30948174348246471,"x":0.5164609017627757,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.022527575633270236,"x":0.51410908857998994,"w":0.3607429758707682,"t":"to recover from trawling and dredging,","y":0.32644140850929659},{"t":"permitting rivers to flow freely again.","y":0.34575994557799317,"x":0.51427018046808382,"w":0.34190849304199211,"h":0.019393213224916384,"c":1},{"x":0.51425759962223561,"w":0.3789406585693359,"t":"Above all, it means bringing back missing","y":0.3629797960021508,"c":1,"h":0.020804788254736639},{"t":"species. One of the most striking findings","x":0.51215145783876592,"c":1,"h":0.020313004582453442,"y":0.38103968686906842,"w":0.38108884175618485},{"t":"of modern ecology is that ecosystems","h":0.019049304112950027,"c":1,"x":0.51420164654788547,"w":0.34402748107910164,"y":0.39953955957980214},{"y":0.41860465101157218,"x":0.51234567354291127,"t":"without large predators behave in","w":0.31275721232096354,"h":0.016024324441826776,"c":1},{"t":"completely different ways from those that","x":0.51234567949346022,"y":0.4360465114620844,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1,"w":0.38477366129557289},{"w":0.38307144165039064,"x":0.51217420885372067,"h":0.019279365404755833,"y":0.45212079071787159,"c":1,"t":"retain them. Some of them drive dynamic"},{"x":0.51223585376956327,"y":0.47177385006314032,"h":0.018695054542891998,"c":1,"w":0.39119720458984375,"t":"processes that resonate through the whole"},{"y":0.48677645286118576,"h":0.022777445043916655,"c":1,"x":0.50993039235868332,"w":0.37312728881835933,"t":"food chain, creating niches for hundreds"},{"h":0.020020497280520688,"y":0.50672291927467394,"w":0.39344131469726573,"t":"of species that might otherwise struggle to","x":0.51211388982759887,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.38322675069173184,"x":0.51005941881277539,"y":0.52317158907156747,"t":"survive. The killers turn out to be bringers","h":0.020859840761505932},{"t":"of life.","x":0.51120073987262205,"y":0.53975246371500063,"h":0.020409111139771507,"w":0.064554754892985011,"c":1},{"w":0.34223996480305985,"x":0.50995948046030881,"y":0.56897808062751754,"h":0.021162800289014849,"c":1,"t":"Such findings present a big challenge"},{"w":0.36419754028320306,"h":0.017470964694612845,"c":1,"y":0.58863368661793936,"t":"to British conservation, which has often","x":0.50823044784440663},{"x":0.50810238057464174,"c":1,"w":0.3665450286865235,"t":"selected arbitrary assemblages of plants","h":0.018671938892809381,"y":0.60562066468373443},{"h":0.01752061248527681,"c":1,"x":0.51028805991625692,"y":0.62499999983732901,"w":0.39917696634928379,"t":"and animals and sought, at great effort and"},{"t":"expense, to prevent them from changing.","x":0.51013053258321439,"h":0.020554381910847463,"w":0.38304349263509119,"y":0.64105730620267143,"c":1},{"w":0.37893170674641929,"c":1,"x":0.50806507444336124,"y":0.65931663831581366,"t":"It has tried to preserve the living world as","h":0.018564208517085734},{"y":0.67534468283154658,"x":0.50785307454204309,"t":"if it were a jar of pickles, letting nothing","w":0.36704867045084644,"h":0.022804790447401357,"c":1},{"w":0.34567901611328122,"x":0.50823045063948225,"y":0.696113074445466,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"t":"in and nothing out, keeping nature in"},{"h":0.018614449967203517,"w":0.337860107421875,"y":0.71200507075625563,"c":1,"t":"a state of arrested development. But","x":0.50803093558793877},{"y":0.7325581393849615,"t":"ecosystems are not merely collections of","w":0.36831275939941421,"x":0.50823045144339352,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1},{"t":"species; they are also the dynamic and","h":0.022274399253027433,"c":1,"y":0.74680972161443981,"x":0.50805067085942068,"w":0.35015487670898438},{"c":1,"h":0.018861467341230953,"x":0.50809398278206852,"y":0.76608924917695875,"t":"ever-shifting relationships between them.","w":0.38096120198567718},{"c":1,"y":0.78263431503781844,"h":0.021402142213567621,"t":"And this dynamism often depends on large","x":0.50794601929550376,"w":0.39561141967773428},{"t":"predators.","x":0.50786279259531075,"c":1,"w":0.097560571034749355,"h":0.018145637602070441,"y":0.80172654688371714},{"h":0.020001765274748839,"y":0.82899653994845279,"c":1,"w":0.35453971862792966,"t":"At sea the potential is even greater: by","x":0.50586652254130782},{"c":1,"t":"protecting large areas from commercial","x":0.50617283918229405,"y":0.84883720914976635,"w":0.36213991800944023,"h":0.016003780005537038},{"t":"fishing, we could once more see what","x":0.50586005221468999,"y":0.86443143672751011,"w":0.35036692301432304,"c":1,"h":0.020845896223268268},{"y":0.88346369435295546,"c":1,"w":0.34397201538085931,"h":0.017750316008802614,"x":0.50803822312276303,"t":"18th-century literature describes: vast"},{"c":1,"t":"shoals of fish being chased by fin and","x":0.50411522434562273,"y":0.90106007058513593,"w":0.34567901611328122,"h":0.019140164899882239},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.87860082257983929,"y":0.93895348816880331,"t":"83","w":0.026748971939086874},{"h":0.016454192297478354,"w":0.20824633280436194,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721299237268,"y":0.96768258536995222}]}